      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go back through the conversation line by line.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Я хочу, чтобы ты знала.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I want you to know.' Standing on the crate, Max tells Vika he wants her to know one thing.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Я люблю тебя.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I love you.' He declares openly that he loves her. Then Vika responds.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Прекрати.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Stop it.' Vika sharply tells him to cut out the act.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Ты хочешь вешаться?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you want to hang yourself?' She asks sarcastically if he really plans to hang himself.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Мне все равно.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I don't care.' She adds coldly that she does not care either way.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Постой.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Wait.' Max calls out for her to wait before she leaves.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Я не шучу.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am not joking.' As the crate shifts under him, he insists he is not joking.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Помоги!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Help!' Slipping for real, Max gasps for help.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Что вы наделали, Виктория?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What have you done, Victoria?' Kostya rushes in on cue and asks Victoria what she has done.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Вы убили его.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You killed him.' Still acting out the script, Kostya accuses her of killing Max. Then Vika responds.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Костя, помоги ему!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Kostya, help him!' Realizing Max is actually strangling, Vika yells at Kostya to save him.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Ты реально повесился?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
